            <footer class="blockquote-footer">Lina, Alexandria</footer>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <blockquote class="blockquote">
            <p class="mb-3">“Perfect for temporary needs – I rented a lapbottom for a trip.”</p>
            <footer class="blockquote-footer">Omar, Giza</footer>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section> -->

</main>




